  "description": "DynamoMapper is a source generator for .NET that generates fast, strongly-typed mappings between your domain models and Amazon DynamoDB AttributeValue dictionaries.\n\n      Designed for DynamoDB single-table patterns, it provides compile-time validation and high-performance, zero-reflection mapping code—without requiring AWS attributes on your entities. Install this package to enable code generation; it references DynamoMapper.Runtime for shared attributes and helpers.",
